     fhir:Narrative.div "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><div xml:lang=\"en\" lang=\"en\"><hr/><p><b>English</b></p><hr/><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>Generated Narrative: CodeSystem KGGradeStrength</b></p><a name=\"KGGradeStrength\"> </a><a name=\"hcKGGradeStrength\"> </a><p>This case-sensitive code system <code>http://smart.who.int/base/CodeSystem/KGGradeStrength</code> defines the following codes:</p><table class=\"codes\"><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><b>Code</b></td><td><b>Display</b></td><td><b>Definition</b></td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">strong<a name=\"KGGradeStrength-strong\"> </a></td><td>Strong</td><td>The guideline panel is confident that the desirable effects of following the recommendation clearly outweigh the undesirable effects — or clearly do not, for a recommendation against — so most informed people would choose the recommended course.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">conditional<a name=\"KGGradeStrength-conditional\"> </a></td><td>Conditional</td><td>The desirable effects probably outweigh the undesirable effects, but the panel is less confident: the balance is close, the evidence uncertain, or values and preferences vary, so different choices will suit different people or settings. GRADE's 'weak'; WHO uses 'conditional'.</td></tr></table></div><div xml:lang=\"fr\" lang=\"fr\"><hr/><p><b>French</b></p><hr/><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>Narratif généré : CodeSystem KGGradeStrength</b></p><a name=\"fr-KGGradeStrength\"> </a><a name=\"fr-hcKGGradeStrength\"> </a><p>This case-sensitive code system <code>http://smart.who.int/base/CodeSystem/KGGradeStrength</code> defines the following codes:</p><table class=\"codes\"><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><b>Code</b></td><td><b>Affichage</b></td><td><b>Définition</b></td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">strong<a name=\"fr-KGGradeStrength-strong\"> </a></td><td>Strong</td><td>The guideline panel is confident that the desirable effects of following the recommendation clearly outweigh the undesirable effects — or clearly do not, for a recommendation against — so most informed people would choose the recommended course.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">conditional<a name=\"fr-KGGradeStrength-conditional\"> </a></td><td>Conditional</td><td>The desirable effects probably outweigh the undesirable effects, but the panel is less confident: the balance is close, the evidence uncertain, or values and preferences vary, so different choices will suit different people or settings. GRADE's 'weak'; WHO uses 'conditional'.</td></tr></table></div><div xml:lang=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\"><hr/><p><b>Arabic</b></p><hr/><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>السرد المُنشأ: CodeSystem KGGradeStrength</b></p><a name=\"ar-KGGradeStrength\"> </a><a name=\"ar-hcKGGradeStrength\"> </a><p>يُعرّف هذا case-sensitive نظام الشيفرة <code>http://smart.who.int/base/CodeSystem/KGGradeStrength</code> الرمز التالي<f test=\"code-count != 1\">s</f>:</p><table class=\"codes\"><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><b>الكود</b></td><td><b>العرض</b></td><td><b>التعريف</b></td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">strong<a name=\"ar-KGGradeStrength-strong\"> </a></td><td>Strong</td><td>The guideline panel is confident that the desirable effects of following the recommendation clearly outweigh the undesirable effects — or clearly do not, for a recommendation against — so most informed people would choose the recommended course.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">conditional<a name=\"ar-KGGradeStrength-conditional\"> </a></td><td>Conditional</td><td>The desirable effects probably outweigh the undesirable effects, but the panel is less confident: the balance is close, the evidence uncertain, or values and preferences vary, so different choices will suit different people or settings. GRADE's 'weak'; WHO uses 'conditional'.</td></tr></table></div><div xml:lang=\"zh\" lang=\"zh\"><hr/><p><b>Chinese</b></p><hr/><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>Generated Narrative: 代码系统 KGGradeStrength</b></p><a name=\"zh-KGGradeStrength\"> </a><a name=\"zh-hcKGGradeStrength\"> </a><p>This case-sensitive code system <code>http://smart.who.int/base/CodeSystem/KGGradeStrength</code> defines the following codes:</p><table class=\"codes\"><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><b>Code</b></td><td><b>Display</b></td><td><b>Definition</b></td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">strong<a name=\"zh-KGGradeStrength-strong\"> </a></td><td>Strong</td><td>The guideline panel is confident that the desirable effects of following the recommendation clearly outweigh the undesirable effects — or clearly do not, for a recommendation against — so most informed people would choose the recommended course.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">conditional<a name=\"zh-KGGradeStrength-conditional\"> </a></td><td>Conditional</td><td>The desirable effects probably outweigh the undesirable effects, but the panel is less confident: the balance is close, the evidence uncertain, or values and preferences vary, so different choices will suit different people or settings. GRADE's 'weak'; WHO uses 'conditional'.</td></tr></table></div><div xml:lang=\"ru\" lang=\"ru\"><hr/><p><b>Russian</b></p><hr/><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>Сгенерированный нарратив: CodeSystem KGGradeStrength</b></p><a name=\"ru-KGGradeStrength\"> </a><a name=\"ru-hcKGGradeStrength\"> </a><p>Данная система кодов <code>http://smart.who.int/base/CodeSystem/KGGradeStrength</code> case-sensitive определяет следующие коды:</p><table class=\"codes\"><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><b>Код</b></td><td><b>Отображение</b></td><td><b>Определение</b></td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">strong<a name=\"ru-KGGradeStrength-strong\"> </a></td><td>Strong</td><td>The guideline panel is confident that the desirable effects of following the recommendation clearly outweigh the undesirable effects — or clearly do not, for a recommendation against — so most informed people would choose the 